  叫外公 | call someone maternal grandfather / address as grandpa

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  大公无私 | dà gōng wú sī | selfless and impartial; perfectly just
  外圆内方 | wài yuán nèi fāng | round on the outside and square on the inside; gentle in appearance but firm in principle
  公私分明 | gōng sī fēn míng | make a clear distinction between public and private interests
  逍遥法外 | xiāo yáo fǎ wài | remain at large outside the law; unfettered by legal justice

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  外 | wài | outer; outside; external; maternal | exterior; fuera; externo; materno | 夕 | evening / night | 夕 (evening) + 卜 (divination crack) | 卜 (bǔ, phonetic / divining rod) | 5 | 左右结构 | Depicts nighttime divination (夕 + 卜) performed outside the ancestral temple or home borders, abstracting into 'exterior' or maternal kin outside the patrilineage. | Performing night divination (夕) with a carved bone (卜) outside the boundary walls of the house. | Realizar una adivinación nocturna (夕) con una vara (卜) más allá de los muros del hogar. | 51 | NIY | ""
  公 | gōng | public; male elder; fair; grandfather | público; anciano; abuelo; justo | 八 | eight / divide | 八 (divide open / distribute fairly) + 厶 (private interest) | 八 (bā, opening up) | 4 | 上下结构 | Ideogrammic compound of 八 (dividing open) over 厶 (private interest), signifying breaking open selfish interests for the common welfare; hence an honorable elder or patriarch. | Opening up (八) selfish private wealth (厶) to serve the common good, embodying the fair authority of an honorable grandfather. | Abrir y repartir (八) los bienes privados (厶) en beneficio de todos, mostrando la generosidad de un digno abuelo. | 55 | CI | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: The honorable male elder (公) from the maternal outside line (外) is the beloved maternal grandfather (外公).
  composite_memory_hook_es: El venerable patriarca (公) del linaje externo materno (外) es el querido abuelo materno (外公).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In traditional Chinese kinship terminology, relatives on the mother's side carry the prefix 'wài' (外, external lineage), reflecting ancient patrilineal clan structures. However, in emotional daily life, 外公 often shares an exceptionally warm, indulgent bond with grandchildren without patriarchal disciplinary friction.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Falling 4th tone 'wài' (51) followed by high level 1st tone 'gōng' (55). Make a decisive drop on 'wài' before lifting into a steady high pitch on 'gōng'.

