    卧 | wò | lie down; recline | Has 臣 on the left of 卜 instead of 夕
    瓮 | wèng | earthen jar | Has 公 on top of 瓦 (tile/pottery)
    讼 | sòng | litigation; sue | Has speech radical 讠 next to 公
    翁 | wēng | elderly man; father | Has 公 on top of 羽 (feathers)
